{"status": "ok", "language": null, "cues": [{"t": 69.77, "d": 1.83, "text": "第十集"}, {"t": 71.7, "d": 3.0, "text": "三次危险"}, {"t": 75.2, "d": 5.23, "text": "孙悟空走进师父的房间"}, {"t": 80.5, "d": 5.33, "text": "师父果然在里面等它"}, {"t": 85.97, "d": 4.17, "text": "孙悟空跪在师父面前"}, {"t": 90.37, "d": 4.83, "text": "师父要教它不死的方法"}, {"t": 97.6, "d": 3.83, "text": "师父小声地教它"}, {"t": 101.67, "d": 4.2, "text": "孙悟空认真地听"}, {"t": 106.0, "d": 2.27, "text": "不知不觉"}, {"t": 108.27, "d": 4.73, "text": "天亮了"}, {"t": 114.27, "d": 4.5, "text": "孙悟空从后门走了出去"}, {"t": 118.97, "d": 6.17, "text": "回到了它和其他人的房间"}, {"t": 125.3, "d": 2.93, "text": "其他人还在睡"}, {"t": 128.53, "d": 5.67, "text": "其他人不知道师父教了孙悟空"}, {"t": 137.77, "d": 8.17, "text": "白天 孙悟空和其他人一起学习"}, {"t": 146.17, "d": 1.8, "text": "没有人的时候"}, {"t": 148.47, "d": 4.3, "text": "它一个人练习"}, {"t": 152.77, "d": 1.57, "text": "晚上"}, {"t": 154.33, "d": 3.3, "text": "它也认真练习"}, {"t": 158.67, "d": 4.87, "text": "三年过去了"}, {"t": 163.8, "d": 3.7, "text": "师父问 你学会了吗"}, {"t": 168.67, "d": 1.23, "text": "孙悟空说"}, {"t": 170.5, "d": 2.27, "text": "我学会了"}, {"t": 174.0, "d": 3.77, "text": "师父说 这还不够"}, {"t": 178.4, "d": 4.3, "text": "以后你会遇到三次危险"}, {"t": 184.97, "d": 5.47, "text": "第一次危险 是很大的雷"}, {"t": 190.57, "d": 4.0, "text": "五百年以后雷会打下来"}, {"t": 194.8, "d": 2.47, "text": "你一定要躲开"}, {"t": 198.67, "d": 3.1, "text": "孙悟空认真地听"}, {"t": 203.57, "d": 2.23, "text": "再过五百年"}, {"t": 206.7, "d": 3.03, "text": "火会来"}, {"t": 209.73, "d": 2.6, "text": "这不是普通的火"}, {"t": 212.33, "d": 4.77, "text": "火会从你的身体里面烧起来"}, {"t": 217.57, "d": 1.93, "text": "这次危险"}, {"t": 219.5, "d": 2.83, "text": "你也要躲开"}, {"t": 223.77, "d": 2.2, "text": "再过五百年"}, {"t": 226.57, "d": 4.1, "text": "大风会来"}, {"t": 231.07, "d": 3.8, "text": "风会进入你的身体"}, {"t": 235.47, "d": 3.53, "text": "这次危险你也要躲开"}, {"t": 240.4, "d": 5.23, "text": "孙悟空听了很害怕"}, {"t": 247.17, "d": 3.87, "text": "孙悟空向师父行礼"}, {"t": 251.27, "d": 0.93, "text": "它说"}, {"t": 252.87, "d": 5.17, "text": "请教我躲开危险的方法"}, {"t": 258.33, "d": 7.0, "text": "师父说 可是你和人不一样"}, {"t": 266.8, "d": 1.33, "text": "孙悟空问"}, {"t": 269.0, "d": 1.53, "text": "哪里不一样"}, {"t": 273.13, "d": 6.13, "text": "师父说 你的脸颊比人小"}, {"t": 279.5, "d": 3.43, "text": "孙悟空摸摸自己的脸"}, {"t": 283.1, "d": 7.03, "text": "它说 可是我的嘴里有放东西的小袋子"}, {"t": 290.37, "d": 2.73, "text": "师父笑了"}, {"t": 293.1, "d": 4.43, "text": "说 好 我教你"}, {"t": 297.8, "d": 2.4, "text": "师父会教它什么呢"}, {"t": 300.2, "d": 1.5, "text": "我们下回说"}], "en_cues": [{"t": 69.77, "d": 1.83, "text": "Episode 10"}, {"t": 71.7, "d": 3.0, "text": "Three Dangers"}, {"t": 75.2, "d": 5.23, "text": "Sun Wukong entered his master's room"}, {"t": 80.5, "d": 5.33, "text": "His master was indeed waiting for him inside"}, {"t": 85.97, "d": 4.17, "text": "Sun Wukong knelt before his master"}, {"t": 90.37, "d": 4.83, "text": "His master was going to teach him how to become immortal"}, {"t": 97.6, "d": 3.83, "text": "His master taught him in a low voice"}, {"t": 101.67, "d": 4.2, "text": "Sun Wukong listened carefully"}, {"t": 106.0, "d": 2.27, "text": "Before he knew it"}, {"t": 108.27, "d": 4.73, "text": "dawn had come"}, {"t": 114.27, "d": 4.5, "text": "Sun Wukong went out through the back door"}, {"t": 118.97, "d": 6.17, "text": "and returned to the room he shared with the others"}, {"t": 125.3, "d": 2.93, "text": "The others were still asleep"}, {"t": 128.53, "d": 5.67, "text": "They did not know the master had taught Sun Wukong"}, {"t": 137.77, "d": 8.17, "text": "During the day Sun Wukong studied with the others"}, {"t": 146.17, "d": 1.8, "text": "When no one was around"}, {"t": 148.47, "d": 4.3, "text": "he practiced alone"}, {"t": 152.77, "d": 1.57, "text": "At night"}, {"t": 154.33, "d": 3.3, "text": "he also practiced diligently"}, {"t": 158.67, "d": 4.87, "text": "Three years passed"}, {"t": 163.8, "d": 3.7, "text": "The master asked Have you learned it"}, {"t": 168.67, "d": 1.23, "text": "Sun Wukong said"}, {"t": 170.5, "d": 2.27, "text": "I have learned it"}, {"t": 174.0, "d": 3.77, "text": "The master said That is still not enough"}, {"t": 178.4, "d": 4.3, "text": "You will face three dangers in the future"}, {"t": 184.97, "d": 5.47, "text": "The first danger is a mighty thunderbolt"}, {"t": 190.57, "d": 4.0, "text": "Five hundred years later it will strike"}, {"t": 194.8, "d": 2.47, "text": "You must avoid it"}, {"t": 198.67, "d": 3.1, "text": "Sun Wukong listened carefully"}, {"t": 203.57, "d": 2.23, "text": "After another five hundred years"}, {"t": 206.7, "d": 3.03, "text": "fire will come"}, {"t": 209.73, "d": 2.6, "text": "This is no ordinary fire"}, {"t": 212.33, "d": 4.77, "text": "The fire will burn from inside your body"}, {"t": 217.57, "d": 1.93, "text": "This danger"}, {"t": 219.5, "d": 2.83, "text": "must also be avoided"}, {"t": 223.77, "d": 2.2, "text": "After another five hundred years"}, {"t": 226.57, "d": 4.1, "text": "a powerful wind will come"}, {"t": 231.07, "d": 3.8, "text": "The wind will enter your body"}, {"t": 235.47, "d": 3.53, "text": "You must avoid this danger too"}, {"t": 240.4, "d": 5.23, "text": "Sun Wukong was frightened by what he heard"}, {"t": 247.17, "d": 3.87, "text": "Sun Wukong bowed to his master"}, {"t": 251.27, "d": 0.93, "text": "He said"}, {"t": 252.87, "d": 5.17, "text": "Please teach me how to avoid these dangers"}, {"t": 258.33, "d": 7.0, "text": "The master said But you are different from humans"}, {"t": 266.8, "d": 1.33, "text": "Sun Wukong asked"}, {"t": 269.0, "d": 1.53, "text": "How am I different"}, {"t": 273.13, "d": 6.13, "text": "The master said Your cheeks are smaller than a human's"}, {"t": 279.5, "d": 3.43, "text": "Sun Wukong touched his face"}, {"t": 283.1, "d": 7.03, "text": "He said But I have a small pouch in my mouth for storing things"}, {"t": 290.37, "d": 2.73, "text": "The master laughed"}, {"t": 293.1, "d": 4.43, "text": "and said All right I will teach you"}, {"t": 297.8, "d": 2.4, "text": "What will his master teach him"}, {"t": 300.2, "d": 1.5, "text": "To be continued"}], "video_id": "2JgENoTgVmI"}